sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Hannezo et al. (2011) PRL & Shyer et al. (2013) Science sequential smooth-muscle mucosal buckling into ridges, zigzags, and hexagonal villi — Model fidelity to source: 88/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "The Hannezo-Shyer quartic length, bending rigidity and Winkler stiffness (L202-237), the 4-regime classifier (L239-254) and the FvK energy are implemented, and Pass 3 adds a genuinely new mechanical layer: a Lamé-verified axisymmetric neo-Hookean ring FEM of the mesenchymal annulus with slab limit, curvature factor and prestrain tangent (L261-365), integer circumferential mode quantisation and the Donnell validity ratio (L368-419), and a curvature-driven Shh/BMP cluster field with a localized cubic gain and linear spectral Newton response (L422-514, L734-793), all with 6 machine-checked Lean theorems. Deductions: the v2 item asked for a 3D tubular FEM and the delivered foundation is 1D-radial axisymmetric feeding a scalar K_eff into a flat sheet, while the script's own Donnell ratio (gamma = 0.65 at E8) says the flat reduction is poorly justified at the ridge stages (-4); the zigzag angle is taken from the observed target with an unsourced 0.92 fallback (L666-669) and the relaxed surface is blended 0.85 prescribed cosine + 0.15 relaxed (L732), so the zigzag geometry is imposed rather than selected (-4); the L-BFGS-B minimiser stops on its 65-iteration limit on an ill-conditioned L_op^2 (L722) and the Pass 3 coupling therefore uses a linearised response rather than re-minimising (-2); the Shh field has no reaction-diffusion kinetics and its elbow curvature is a contour-turning proxy, as the docstring admits (-2); the ring-FEM outer wall is rigid (infinitely stiff smooth muscle) (-1); credit (+1 net) for the ablation flags and the honest statement of every reduction in docstrings." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py L666–L677: theta_zz_deg taken from target_theta_zz_deg (observed) with unsourced 0.92 fallback; hexagonal regime theta_zz_deg = 58.5 literal — zigzag geometry is prescribed, not selected <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py#L666-L677>",
            "2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py L722–L732: L-BFGS-B maxiter 65 on the ill-conditioned L_op^2 followed by the 0.85 prescribed-cosine / 0.15 relaxed blend of the surface <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py#L722-L732>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity-3>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity-4>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity-5>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity-6>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity-7> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.88"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity-1> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py L202–L254" ;
        dct:description "Mucosal bending rigidity B_e, foundation stiffness K_s, quartic length ell_* with C_LAMBDA_PREFACTOR, and the 4-regime classifier" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py#L202-L254> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity-2> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py L261–L365" ;
        dct:description "neo_hookean_tangent_modulus, lame_thick_cylinder_stiffness and the 48-element axisymmetric plane-strain ring FEM tubular_neo_hookean_foundation (rigid outer wall u=0, unit inward epithelial displacement) returning K_tube, K_slab, curvature_factor, prestrain_factor, K_eff" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py#L261-L365> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity-3> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py L368–L419" ;
        dct:description "donnell_curvature_ratio and compute_tubular_length_and_wavelength: ell_tube, lambda_tube, integer mode quantisation n = round(2 pi R / lambda) (Lean Law 4), Donnell gamma" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py#L368-L419> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity-4> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py L563–L588" ;
        dct:description "Tubular coupling block inside relax_fvk_mucosal_surface rescaling ell_*, lambda_*, N_c from K_eff and recording the tube summary" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py#L563-L588> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity-5> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py L422–L514" ;
        dct:description "compute_shh_bmp_cluster_field (Gaussian-smoothed positive Laplacian amplified by crest-contour turning curvature, 82nd-percentile soft threshold, connected-component count) and summarize_cluster_localization (elbow index, crest/tip fraction)" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py#L422-L514> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity-6> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py L734–L793" ;
        dct:description "Localized cubic gain alpha_3(x,y) = alpha_3 + 0.60 C and the linear spectral Newton response with a 30% trust region; elbow bulge measured against the pass-1 surface" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py#L734-L793> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity-7> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_063_epithelial_buckling_crypt_villus.lean L29–L149" ;
        dct:description "6 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys): wavenumber stationarity, FK506 arrest hierarchy, hexagonal triad closure, tubular_mode_quantization, shh_bmp_elbow_localization, shh_bmp_elbow_villus_nucleation; `lean` exits 0" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_063_epithelial_buckling_crypt_villus.lean#L29-L149> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Claude Fable 5.1 (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 063 Pass 3 Phase B Assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "claude-fable-5-1" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://www.anthropic.com> .
}

